planwright has no third-party runtime dependencies. The plan it reads is a plain
Markdown file, and the engine (parsing, dependency graph, critical path,
validation) uses only the Python standard library. The optional test extra
pulls in pytest (MIT) for development only; it is not required to run the tool.
